    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Candlelight</strong> \u2013 A Puzzle Game of Shape, Color, and Alchemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong><br>Candlelight is a puzzle game where each shape you place onto the grid inverts the color of the space it occupies. Every inversion offers the opportunity to alchemize a gem and advance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Modes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode</strong><br><i>Solve puzzles using limited shapes.</i><br>Complete 50 levels across 9 worlds, each challenging you to work with a limited number of shapes. Every move counts as you aim for the most efficient solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Play</strong><br><i>Unwind and play at your own pace.</i><br>There\u2019s no goal here\u2014just relax, enjoy the music, and experiment with shapes to your heart\u2019s content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Challenge</strong><br><i>Solve the daily challenge with the fewest moves.</i><br>Every day brings a fresh puzzle. Compete with friends to see who can solve it using the fewest shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial</strong><br><i>Master the game\u2019s basics.</i><br>New to Candlelight? The tutorial will guide you through core mechanics, ensuring you\u2019re ready to tackle the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Designer (Coming Soon)</strong><br><i>Build your own levels.</i><br>Unleash your creativity by crafting custom puzzles. Share them with the community and challenge others once this feature is available.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Candlelight</strong> \u2013 A Puzzle Game of Shape, Color, and Alchemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong><br>Candlelight is a puzzle game where each shape you place onto the grid inverts the color of the space it occupies. Every inversion offers the opportunity to alchemize a gem and advance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Modes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode</strong><br><i>Solve puzzles using limited shapes.</i><br>Complete 50 levels across 9 worlds, each challenging you to work with a limited number of shapes. Every move counts as you aim for the most efficient solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Play</strong><br><i>Unwind and play at your own pace.</i><br>There\u2019s no goal here\u2014just relax, enjoy the music, and experiment with shapes to your heart\u2019s content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Challenge</strong><br><i>Solve the daily challenge with the fewest moves.</i><br>Every day brings a fresh puzzle. Compete with friends to see who can solve it using the fewest shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial</strong><br><i>Master the game\u2019s basics.</i><br>New to Candlelight? The tutorial will guide you through core mechanics, ensuring you\u2019re ready to tackle the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Designer (Coming Soon)</strong><br><i>Build your own levels.</i><br>Unleash your creativity by crafting custom puzzles. Share them with the community and challenge others once this feature is available.</p>",
